          "sectionId": "prototype-guided-actions-v1",
          "heading": "Guided steps and locked actions",
          "claimKind": "prototype_behavior",
          "text": "DigiLicense explains the current prototype step and why a displayed action is locked. It does not decide legal eligibility, verify records, or change an application."
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "prototype-waitlist-offers-v1",
          "heading": "Waitlist and offers",
          "claimKind": "prototype_behavior",
          "text": "The DigiLicense appointment waitlist and any offer timer are simulated prototype behavior. They demonstrate a transparent workflow and do not reserve a real appointment."
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "prototype-synthetic-service-flows-v1",
          "heading": "Status, payment, address, and mobile updates",
          "claimKind": "prototype_behavior",
          "text": "DigiLicense status, payment, address-change, and mobile-update flows are synthetic. The assistant can explain a displayed reason code but cannot inspect or alter personal records."
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "prototype-assistant-scope-v1",
          "heading": "Scope and fallback",
          "claimKind": "prototype_behavior",
          "text": "The assistant provides evidence-grounded explanations only. If reviewed evidence is insufficient, it returns deterministic guidance instead of guessing."
        }
      ],
